 function networkEmpty(i){if(i===0)return 'Add the colleagues you’d count on, the way you would in a group practice. Use “Add as trusted” on anyone’s profile or in Find colleagues.';if(i===1)return 'Colleagues appear here automatically after a referral, cover arrangement or consultation together. Anyone you’ve already added is listed under Trusted colleagues.';return 'No one to suggest yet. Suggestions are colleagues licensed where you are whose specialties overlap with yours, and they appear here as more join.';}
